{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwXLxre2364DKpkx5fAp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I created the dashboard and the alert rule, and the rule is enabled. Its first run finished with status `ok`.\n\n**1. The data:** `kibana_sample_data_logs` holds about 14,000 web-server requests timed by `timestamp`, from 2026-10-04 to 2026-12-03. Each request has the response code, URL, bytes sent, client IP, source and destination country, OS and user agent. There are only three response codes:\n- 200: 12,832 requests\n- 404: 801 requests\n- 503: 441 requests (the only 5xx code)\n\n**2. Dashboard \"EFF-d88cc2ce Web logs overview\":** it has 7 panels:\n- Single-number panels for total requests, unique visitors (distinct client IPs) and total bytes served\n- Requests over time, split by response code\n- Share of requests by response code (pie chart)\n- Top 10 URLs, with request count and average bytes\n- Top 10 source countries\n\nLink: http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-d88cc2ce-web-logs-overview-dd3ebaab9b51\n\n**3. Alert rule \"EFF-d88cc2ce 5xx spike\"** (id `a5dddbe7-8a1b-49f6-99b1-ebcbb64ec4fc`): every minute, it counts requests in `kibana_sample_data_logs` whose response code starts with \"5\". It fires when more than 10 arrive within the last 5 minutes, measured by `timestamp`.\n\nThe rule has no actions attached, so when it fires it only shows up as an alert in Kibana and sends no notifications. If you want emails, Slack messages or another channel, you'll need to set up a connector and add it to the rule."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":706,"cache_read_input_tokens":21660,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":706},"output_tokens":565,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4eb1cb7-866c-5bbf-8d81-a8d5acd83be3","uuid":"bf8c6b72-15a0-46f1-ae4f-d5b239707ebc","timestamp":"2026-10-12T02:05:30.501Z","request_id":"req_011CfwXLxN8nU2AdxKoSAAnq"}
